{"id":"H1476","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","sayIt":"gu-NI","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Guni","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Naphtali living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.24;\nson of: Naphtali (H5321);\nbrother of: Jahzeel (H3183), Jezer (H3337) and Shillem (H8006)\nAlso named: gu.ni (גּוּנִי \"Gunite\" H1477)\n§ Guni = \"my defender (?)\"\n1) a son of Naphtali and founder of the family of Gunites\n2) a descendant of Gad","glosses":["guni"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Guni","kjv":"and Guni"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":48,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Guni","kjv":"of Guni"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Guni","kjv":"of Guni"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Guni","kjv":"and Guni"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:24","note":"The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:48","note":"The sons of Naphtali after their families: of Jahzeel, the family of the Jahzeelites; of Guni, the family of the Gunites;","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 5:15","note":"Ahi the son of Abdiel, the son of Guni, chief of their fathers’ houses.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1477","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","gloss":"Gunite"},{"id":"H5321","lemma":"נַפְתָּלִי","transliteration":"naphtali","gloss":"Naphtali"},{"id":"H3183","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵל","transliteration":"yachtseel","gloss":"Jahzeel"},{"id":"H3337","lemma":"יֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"yetser","gloss":"Jezer"},{"id":"H8006","lemma":"שִׁלֵּם","transliteration":"shillem","gloss":"Shillem"},{"id":"H5661","lemma":"עַבְדִּיאֵל","transliteration":"avdiel","gloss":"Abdiel"},{"id":"H3184","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵלִי","transliteration":"yachtseeli","gloss":"Jahzeelite"},{"id":"H3185","lemma":"יַחְצִיאֵל","transliteration":"yachtsiel","gloss":"Jahziel"}],"senses":[{"id":"H1476H","gloss":"Guni","relation":"H1476H ="}],"sources":["STEPBib